   "text": "Birmingham City University International College - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nBirmingham City University International College\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nBCUIC is an affiliate college of Birmingham City University. With around 22,000 students, Birmingham City University is one of the larger UK universities. The University offers more than 350 undergraduate and postgraduate courses. International students rate the University highly for its sports and social facilities, affordable accommodation, interaction with lecturers, and the advice and guidance they receive from university staff. BCUIC’s flexible entry system, personalised educational philosophy, dedicated support team and picturesque location make it an ideal place for international students to study and live.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n05/05/2026 05:48\nby Eston Dalmeida\nCreated\n30/03/2026 07:52\nby Gunia Beniwal\nType\nPathway\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nYearly Fees\nMax: £18,500.00\nMin: £13,500.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n15%\n4,650 of 31,000 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPublic\nProvider\nNAVITAS\nFounded Year\n2007\nCampus(es)\nBirmingham\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nExcluded Countries\nAustralia, Cuba, Iran, North Korea, Syria, United States\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n27/03/2026\nContract End Date\n01/04/2029\nContract Entity\nQS Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nhttps://www.bcuic.navitas.com/accommodation\nScholarship Offered\nhttps://www.bcuic.navitas.com/scholarships\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=e6HCzpo8eJE\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\n-",
